      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brand New 4 Bedroom Home – Stonehaven, Naas\r\n\r\nHenry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the rental market this superb brand-new 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home in Stonehaven, a beautiful new development by Ballymore in Naas.\r\n\r\nThis is a first-let property, giving tenants the opportunity to be the very first to call this impressive new home their own.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern living in mind, this stylish home offers bright and spacious accommodation, contemporary finishes and generous living spaces throughout. The property provides the ideal combination of comfort, quality and low-maintenance modern living.\r\n\r\nA New Community in an Excellent Naas Location\r\n\r\nStonehaven is more than just a new development — it is a thoughtfully designed new community where residents can enjoy green spaces, parks, walking and cycling routes, recreation areas and a strong sense of community.\r\n\r\nThe development is ideally located in Naas, offering easy access to the town and its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, schools, sports facilities and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, Stonehaven also offers excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas, making it an ideal location for those looking to enjoy the convenience of Naas while remaining well connected to the capital.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\nBrand-new 4-bedroom home\r\n3 bathrooms\r\nFirst let\r\nBuilt by Ballymore\r\nLocated in the new Stonehaven development\r\nContemporary, high-quality finishes\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation\r\nModern design throughout\r\nExcellent new community environment\r\nGreen spaces and recreational amenities within the development\r\nConvenient location close to Naas town\r\nExcellent transport and road links to Dublin\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to be the first tenant in a beautiful new Ballymore home, within one of Naas' most exciting new residential communities.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
